      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chuma chanimwekesheleliyi Mwanta Yehova. Kutala, hakwila tubola hatachikaŋa kumena matahu akukuminina; hikumena kwakukuminina kwelaŋa neyi mwanta nakesi dehi matahu indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu anamanishi dehi kudya matahu amwituŋa, hinukwila nami, Eyi Mwanta Yehova, anakenaku mwani, nalembi! Indi Yakoba wakemana ŋahi? muloŋayena himunyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakufuntisha muchima mwivumu hansaŋu iyi; Yehova nindi, Hichakekalaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chuma chanmwekesheleliyi Yehova. Kutala, Mwanta Yehova hakutambika kusompesha kwakusompesha nakesi; hikakulasha inyiŋi deneni, hikakukeŋa kulasha nimpata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukwila nami, Eyi Mwanta Yehova, lekaku mwani, nalembi! Indi Yakoba wakemana ŋahi? muloŋa yena himunyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakufuntisha muchima mwivumu hansaŋu iyi; Yehova nindi, Nichumichi nawa hichakekalaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chuma chanmwekesheleliyi. Kutala, Mwanta nemani kumbaŋu yakutuŋa namwonji wakuzenzumuna, muchikasa chindi mudi mwonji wakuzenzumuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuŋila nindi, Eyi Amosa, wunamoni chumanyi? Nami, Mwonji wakuzenzumuna. Mwanta nindi, Tiya, nakasha mwonji wakuzenzumuna mukachi kawantu ami aIsarela, hinakahitila nawa cheŋi kudi wenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yinaŋanaŋa yaIsaka yakabalumuka yihembi, malala aIsarela akashesheka; nakanyamukila akwamutaŋa waYerobowami nampoku yakabali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi kapristu wakuBeteli Amaziya hakutemesha mazu kudi mwanta wawaIsarela Yerobowami, nindi, Amosa nakukwati chikuchi mukachi kawakwamutaŋa waIsarela; ituŋa hidinatweshi mazu indi ejimaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Amosa nahoshi dehi nindi, Yerobowami wakafwa nampoku yakabali, niaIsarela chalala akayifumisha mwituŋa dawu akayitwala muwukoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziya hakumwila Amosa, nindi, Eyi mukwakumona, temukaku wuyi mwituŋa daYuda, wakadiiluku yakudya yeyi, wakaprofweteluku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bayi wakaprofwetaŋa nawa cheŋi kuBeteluku; muloŋa diku kumalala amwanta, diku nawa kuchipaŋu chamwanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amosa hakwakula, hakumwila Amaziya nindi, Ami hinikaprofwetuku, hela mwana kakaprofwetuku; nikabiŋa kwami, nimukwakukunkula nyishikimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova diyi wanfumishili kumudimu wakulondela mukuya mukanka wanyikoku, Yehova diyi nawa waŋilili nindi, Yaku wakaprofweti kudi antu ami aIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu tiyaku izu daYehova. Eyi wudi nakwila neyi, Bayi wakaprofwetaŋa mazu akubayisha aIsarelaku, bayi wutaŋisha mazu akubayisha akwamutaŋa waIsakaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu tiya mwanahoshiyi Yehova. Nindi, Iŋodeyi wakekala chivumbi mutawuni, anyaneyi amayala nawambanda akadimboka nampoku jatubali, nimpata yeyi akayibalula balula namwonji; nineyi aweni wakafwila mwituŋa dakadi kujila, chalala niaIsarela akayifumisha mwituŋa dawu, akayitwala muwukoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
